 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(S'_x \times S'_y \times S'_z)$, proportional to the output volume size. Each output voxel requires 8 lookups and 6 interpolations [S2, unofficial].
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(S'_x \times S'_y \times S'_z)$ for the output array [S2, unofficial].
