 ## Background
-Image Shrinking is implemented in VTK as `vtkImageShrink3D` [S1, unofficial]. It is used in 3D medical imaging and volume rendering pipelines to reduce data size for visualization or texture upload [S1, S2, unofficial]. The method was popularized by VTK's image processing filters [S1, unofficial].
